<section xml:id="sec-AcademicHonesty">
    <title>Academic Honesty Policies</title>

    <p>
        Here's a summary of the types of assignments and what is allowed:
    </p>

    <table>
        <title>What's allowed on each type of assignment.</title>

        <tabular>
            <row bottom="major">
                <cell>
                    <p>
